tarantool-gdb-tools
===================

The repository is BSD 2-Clause (see LICENSE), except for the files
below, which come from other projects and keep their licenses.

luajit_gdb.py
-------------

The LuaJIT debugger extension, from src/luajit_dbg.py of
https://github.com/tarantool/luajit (the LuaJIT of Tarantool), renamed
to luajit_gdb.py here:

- base: commit c4cf7f367fe709f032e7e7f176379579603fff1e, the head of
  the branch elhimov/gh-13094-dbg-avoid-hardcoded-enums by Mikhail
  Elhimov (four commits on tarantool/master 8af934d9);
- lj-gctop: ported from src/luajit-gdb.py of the branch
  elhimov/gh-noticket-gdb-gctop (Sergey Kaplun 53d24a63, Mikhail
  Elhimov 42e6a904);
- the changes of this repository on top, listed by `git log --follow
  luajit_gdb.py`.

License: MIT, the license of LuaJIT (COPYRIGHT of tarantool/luajit),
quoted below.

tests/dbg/upstream/luajit/debug-extension-tests.py
--------------------------------------------------

test/tarantool-debugger-tests/debug-extension-tests.py of
tarantool/luajit at the same commit c4cf7f36, unchanged.  License: MIT,
as above.

tarantool_gdb.py
----------------

The Tarantool debugger extension, from tools/tarantool-gdb.py of
https://github.com/tarantool/tarantool, renamed to tarantool_gdb.py
here:

- base: commit fa8bd1760306454649f128e261a37bfa48fc53b8, the head of
  PR #13078 (branch elhimov/gh-13076-add-fiber-switch-tests by Mikhail
  Elhimov, three commits on tarantool/master 773e8814);
- the MsgPack refactor of PR #9665 by Mikhail Elhimov (ce972e10,
  4f7e2fff), rebased onto it;
- the changes of this repository on top, listed by `git log --follow
  tarantool_gdb.py`.

License: BSD 2-Clause, the license of Tarantool (LICENSE of
tarantool/tarantool), quoted below.

tests/dbg/upstream/tarantool/
-----------------------------

conftest.py, test_gdb.py, utils.py, ut_tt_fiber.py and ut_tl_var.py:
test/gdb/ of tarantool/tarantool at fa8bd176 (PR #13078), unchanged;
test-tarantool-gdb.py: tools/test-tarantool-gdb.py of tarantool/tarantool
at 4f7e2fff (PR #9665), unchanged.  License: BSD 2-Clause, as
tarantool_gdb.py.

